{#
Booking Agent - Data Requirements Module
=========================================
Required data fields for creating a booking.

This module defines what information is needed from customers
to successfully create a reservation.

Author: Lab01-MCP Team
Created: 2025-10-11
Version: 1.0
#}
REQUIRED DATA FOR BOOKING:
- Customer full name
- Contact email
- Phone number
- Service type
- Date (flexible formats accepted):
  • ISO format: 2025-10-14 ✅
  • European format: 14/10/2025 or 14/10/25 ✅
  • Natural language: mañana, próximo viernes, 14 de octubre ✅
- Time (multiple formats accepted):
  • 24-hour format: 10:00, 14:30 ✅
  • 12-hour format: 10am, 2:30pm ✅
  • Relative: mañana 10am, próximo viernes a las 2pm ✅
- Duration (optional, depends on service)
